## ⚡ Quickstart

### 1. Boot Container Mesh
```bash
# Start all core services in background (App, DB, Cache, Ingress)
make up
```

### 2. Database Migrations & Initial Setup
```bash
# Apply pending Alembic migrations
make migrate

# Provision initial superuser from .env settings
make seed
```

### 3. Run Automated Tests
```bash
# Execute hermetic, zero-pollution transactional test suite
make test
```

### 4. Interactive Endpoints
- **Swagger UI:** [http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/docs/swagger](http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/docs/swagger)
- **Scalar UI:** [http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/docs/scalar](http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/docs/scalar)
- **OpenAPI Schema:** [http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/docs/openapi.json](http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/docs/openapi.json)
- **Health Readiness:** [http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/health/ready](http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/health/ready)
- **Prometheus Metrics:** [http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/metrics](http://localhost:{{ app_port }}/metrics)

